    "issue": "force_destroy enabled on IAM user",
    "risk": "Setting force_destroy = true allows deletion of the IAM user even when access keys or other credentials exist, increasing the chance of accidental destructive changes and loss of auditability.",
    "remediation": "In aws_iam_user.user, remove the force_destroy attribute or set force_destroy = false."
  },
