    "issue": "Overly broad IAM permissions",
    "risk": "Wildcard actions ec2:*, s3:*, lambda:*, and cloudwatch:* on Resource=\"*\" grant near-unrestricted access across multiple services, enabling privilege abuse, data theft, resource tampering, and potential account-wide compromise if the user or key is compromised.",
    "remediation": "In aws_iam_user_policy.userpolicy, replace the wildcard actions with only the specific required API actions and replace \"Resource\": \"*\" with the specific ARNs the user needs to access."
  },
